{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/punchnewspaper/posts/at-independence-in-1960-nigeria-had-about-45-million-people/3837300756308058/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/punchnewspaper/posts/at-independence-in-1960-nigeria-had-about-45-million-people/3837300756308058/","title":"Punch Newspapers","description":"At independence in 1960, Nigeria had about 45 million people.","language":"en","text":"At independence in 1960, Nigeria had about 45 million people.\n\nAll reactions:\n\n16 comments\n\n35 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nMorenike Mafoh\n\nSome of the population are not Nigerian but too late to distinguish them. Some are the one causong problems in the nation.\n\nAdeloye Fasona\n\nWhat about the fewer people's that stolen our resources, does countries that you talking about some of their citizens dont like to have babies, let's our government do the right things for their citizens.\n\nChibuike Ezeani\n\nHow can you determine the population of a country without census? The last was done in the last 14yrs and another one isn't insight at all.\n\nOsiegbu Godwin Tony Okoh\n\nFake news\n\nAbdulsalam Sikiru\n\nWe are just too many people, we need to find ways to control the geometrical population growth just like China and other developed countries\n\nAnthony Ihemere\n\nWhy is ours different? China's population is more than six times that of Nigeria, yet she is growing in leaps and bounds in every aspect of human endeavor. If I may ask, are they not of this same planet with us?\n\nOsato Praise\n\nOk\n\nSani Sodangi\n\nDon't relate poverty with population growth. China is a clear case study. Corruption and sadistic greed of our leadership, phsycopantic and blind followership by the citezenry are the major stumbling blocks on the of our collective advancement.\n\n1\n\nOdunayo Abioye\n\nAbeg, NPC, stop all this nonsense! Even if population soars far more than 1960, do our resources not soar? Poverty soars in 9ja just because we've most times had wicked people, rogues and selfish people at the helm of affairs. Population soars in other African countries like Ghana, South Africa etc and in other continents of the world but poverty didn't soar there because they have good, caring and selfless leaders.\n\n3\n\nTop fan\n\nPopulation sours because north dont believe in birth control like the south, a poor Fulani herdsman can have up to 50 children . Tell me how half of the uncared children will not be poor. Moreover, nigeria system where federal allocation is based on ur population, encourages people to reproduce more. During election, u see them boast about their population","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2611.918715003412,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}